{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["And the meaning of <b>ויתחטאו</b> [they purified themselves]: for they too made [it]." "<b>ויכפר עליהם.</b> And he had already made atonement for them. And some say that first they purified themselves and afterward leaned their hands upon the bulls, and it is not far-fetched. If so, the meaning of \"and you shall present the Levites\" is that you have already presented them beforehand."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:52.473357089Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}